# Morrowind Temple: Endryn Llethan's "Silent Pilgrimage" (TT_SanctusShrine). Endryn Llethan offers the vow of silence
# ("Sanctus Shrine": 10, "Take vow of silence" 1: 20); the player speaks to no one until praying at the Sanctus
# Shrine on its island west of Sheogorad (shrineSanctus: 50, the vow lifted). Endryn Llethan rewards the piety (100).
# Position and PositionCell stand in for the travel. Ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05: 05EE7716 the shrine.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_diseasecarrier_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_sanctusshrine_start
talk endryn llethan
ask duties
ask Sanctus Shrine
expect GetJournalIndex TT_SanctusShrine == 10
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TT_SanctusShrine == 20
bye
end

case tt_sanctusshrine_shrine
run
player->Position 12342 173900 1900 0
wait 300
activate 05EE7716
until 300 GetJournalIndex TT_SanctusShrine == 50
end

case tt_sanctusshrine_done
run
player->PositionCell -1031 -150 -616 0 "Vivec, High Fane"
until 600 "endryn llethan"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk endryn llethan
ask Sanctus Shrine
expect GetJournalIndex TT_SanctusShrine == 100
bye
end
